{% markdown %}

Every error reported by PHPStan has an error identifier. Here's [a list of all error identifiers](/error-identifiers). In [PHPStan Pro](/blog/introducing-phpstan-pro){.phpstan-pro-label} you can see the error identifier next to each error and filter errors by their identifiers.

